      <activity id="45bef8e4-56b1-55bb-9a1f-5b15f65aa5e2" activityNameId="6d79a6f4-770c-5777-bbb6-e1a1a86836ca" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Surface treatment, wood-metal window, opaquely painted, wall opening, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Surface treatment, wood-metal window, opaquely painted, wall opening, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The wall opening is 1.8 m2 (assumption width of frame 0.12m, 2/3 of frame are behind the wall opening). The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: 0f5a2491-4848-3ad5-a81b-ca00943af2d1
Included are the materials used for the surface treatment (opaquely painted) for a wood-metal window. Production losses and transport of the materials are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0f5a2491-4848-3ad5-a81b-ca00943af2d1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
